; Regression: after `button { color: red; }` (K0116, RA-8) the lexer stayed in the declaration
; state, so `.a { ... }` was lexed with an interpolation and reported K0100, K0133 and another
; K0100. The element rule now ends its style statement; the next rule parses normally.
(SourceFile
  (ComponentDecl component T
    (MemberList
      (StyleBlock style
        (StyleRule (Selector (CompoundSelector (TypeSelector button))) (ErrorNode color red))
        (StyleRule
          (Selector (CompoundSelector (ClassSelector a)))
          (Declaration color (CssValue blue)))))))
